    <string name="system_services_health_rationale_title">Health data access</string>
    <string name="system_services_health_rationale_body">Floe reads only the Health Connect record types you choose, and only while you ask for a health summary in a task. Floe never writes, deletes or shares your health records, and it does not read them in the background. You can review or revoke every record type in Health Connect settings at any time.</string>
